  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You may bond of a second ally as trinar.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Source-group bond species feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you form a trinar bond you may select an additional creature. You gain a qualifying feat available to each creature. You also gain the effects of a constant status spell on each target.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If using either Spheres of Might or Spheres of Power, the mirrorkin instead gain access to a sphere or talent that they are otherwise qualified.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mirrorkin#toc23\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
